          "exampleId": "w:mental#e-308261d9fc6f3cd8",
          "text": "The benefits of print reading particularly shine through when experimenters move from posing simple tasks – like identifying the main idea in a reading passage – to ones that require mental abstraction – such as drawing inferences from a text.",
